Text_en:
While I was dabbling in the world of fine tuning, this tweet was a major nudge for me. Thank you for 
@MehdiAllahyari
 . After reading more, I realized that most of my needs are met with RAG. Earlier, Mr. Allahyari introduced several platforms based on RAG. I will leave a few here for your opinion.
